ithin a credit or direction. They are based on the text styles for Cascading Style Sheets. The font-family is a comma-separated list of font names. The font-style can be normal or italic. The font-size can be one of the CSS sizes or a numeric point size. The font-weight can be normal or bold. The default is application-dependent, but is a text font vs. a music font.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"color","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"printsObject","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A Boolean value indicating whether to print an object (e.g. a note or a rest). Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if not specified.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLKey":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLKey"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLKey","title":"MXLKey","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLKey"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The key type represents a key signature. Both traditional and non-traditional key signatures are supported.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The optional number attribute refers to staff numbers. If absent, the key signature applies to all staves in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the part. Key signatures appear at the start of each system unless the print-object attribute has been set to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“no”.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlkey"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLKey/Content-swift.enum":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLKey\/Content-swift.enum","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"k